{
  "$schema": "https://aka.ms/codetour-schema",
  "title": "13 - Production",
  "description": "Where everything runs, the settings that must be right, releases, Sentry, and Claude in GitHub.",
  "nextTour": "14 - Login and OAuth",
  "steps": [
    {
